                // Turn 24 goal is a hard 3,000-fan gate, so the fan-farming cascade is ON:
                // farm every 3rd turn, ignore the consecutive-race warning while the gate is
                // live, and keep the extra-race pool to races worth >=3500 fans so farmed
                // turns actually move the counter. Turf A / Dirt A means the whole Junior
